<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA TO OFFER 3-YEAR DEPOSITS.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA TO OFFER 3-YEAR DEPOSITS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading bank Unibanka said on Wednesday that it is to offer deposits for three years.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that in order to be able to offer longer-term loans to clients it needed to have funds deposited in the bank for a longer period.</p>
<p>The bank said it was taking a risk in accepting deposits for three years at a fixed interest rate but said that its analysts had looked at the expected inflation rate and named a special deposit rate of 8.50 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;In this way, Unibanka will get more funds so that clients can get more long-term loans, which is necessary for economic development,&quot; Unibanka added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
